# SalesWon AI Platform Scope

This workspace is the system architecture and engineering home for SalesWon AI. Focus on: product requirements, AI architecture, Azure infrastructure, ServiceNow integration, database design, frontend/backend, governance, security, testing, deployment, technical roadmap.

Avoid pricing, contracts, commercialization, licensing, or partnership strategy unless they directly impact technical architecture.

Read [specifications/](../../specifications/) before implementing.
